  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/11/P1210452.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>(16 fotos) La sala de exposiciones del Centro de Empleo y Cultura de Onda acoge hasta el domingo 22 de noviembre la muestra OPUS-RUN, pinturas y esculturas de Francisco Aldeano, die&ntilde;ador industrial con un amplio bagaje art&iacute;stico multidiscipinar.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofranciscoaldeano/p1210439.jpg\" alt=\"p1210439\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofranciscoaldeano/p1210440.jpg\" alt=\"p1210440\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofranciscoaldeano/p1210441.jpg\" alt=\"p1210441\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofranciscoaldeano/p1210444.jpg\" alt=\"p1210444\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofranciscoaldeano/p1210447.jpg\" alt=\"p1210447\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofranciscoaldeano/p1210448.jpg\" alt=\"p1210448\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofranciscoaldeano/p1210449.jpg\" alt=\"p1210449\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofranciscoaldeano/p1210450.jpg\" alt=\"p1210450\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofranciscoaldeano/p1210451.jpg\" alt=\"p1210451\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofranciscoaldea